OL,3,GNEWSADowning Street's dancing TikToker 
OL,4,Adefends visit                          
OL,6,FAn influencer has insisted his         
OL,7,Finterview with the prime minister      
OL,8,Ffocused on serious issues, despite a   
OL,9,Fbacklash over his recreation of the    
OL,10,Ffamous dance from the film Love        
OL,11,FActually.                              
OL,13,FLuke Hamnett, who has about 1.3 million
OL,14,Ffollowers on TikTok, spoke to Andy     
OL,15,FBurnham at Number 10 for an episode of 
OL,16,Fhis Live, Laugh, Luke podcast.         
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
