OL,3,GNEWSADowning Street's dancing TikToker 
OL,4,Adefends visit                          
OL,6,FHowever, after posting the clip online,
OL,7,Fhe - along with content creators       
OL,8,Fincluding Max Balegde who attended a   
OL,9,Fsocial media reception - were          
OL,10,Fcriticised in the media for turning    
OL,11,FDowning Street into a "laughing stock".
OL,13,FA spokesperson for the prime minister  
OL,14,Finsisted that Burnham "absolutely      
OL,15,Frespects" the history of 10 Downing    
OL,16,FStreet.                                
